      ],
      "source": "https://bryantlibrary.org/local-history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Roslyn’s current train station, part of SEPTA’s Warminster Line, replaced the original in the late 1970s and sits at Susquehanna and Easton Roads.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
